  "content": "<h2><strong>花俏火把！</strong></h2><hr><p>這個材質包將所有火把模型改造成全新且華麗的樣貌。<br>搭配動態紋理！握在手中時也有更好的視覺效果。<br><br><em><strong>適用於原版遊戲</strong></em></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050626/description_ed772def-f7fc-4c88-bb51-f82b81b15d09.gif\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050626/description_364eadbc-2791-4ce1-8656-ae0872744885.gif\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050626/description_dde5862d-3c3e-4bae-aa1c-edcce51a394e.gif\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050626/description_92c22e36-dfec-4864-ac4b-832e6fe0eb8a.gif\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>",
